BBMTLib - Bold Bitcoin MPC TSS Library
Copyright 2025–2026 Bold Bitcoin Wallet

This product includes software from the following open-source projects:

- libtss — DKLs23 MPC backend
  Distribution: https://github.com/BoldBitcoinWallet/libtss (Bold Bitcoin Wallet sustained fork)
  Upstream: https://github.com/0xCarbon/libtss (Apache-2.0 OR MIT)
  Use: Distributed key generation and threshold signing via libtss-go and libtss-ffi.
  Integration: Native libraries built from pinned libtss checkout; Go bindings in BBMTLib/dkls.
  Vendored Rust deps (org mirrors): frost (ZcashFoundation/frost), DKLs23 (0xCarbon/DKLs23)

- Mobile TSS Lib (Vultisig) — GG18 MPC stack
  Source: https://github.com/vultisig/mobile-tss-lib
  License: Apache-2.0
  Modifications: Adapted networking logic; rectified TSS for BTC scope.

This product also uses the following third-party libraries as dependencies:

- Binance TSS Lib (MIT)
  Distribution: https://github.com/BoldBitcoinWallet/tss-lib (v3.0.0)
  Upstream: https://github.com/bnb-chain/tss-lib
- go-nostr (MIT) — https://github.com/nbd-wtf/go-nostr — Nostr relay transport for MPC
- btcsuite / btcd (MIT)
- decred / dcrd (ISC)
- ecies-go (MIT)
- gorilla/mux (BSD-3-Clause)
- go-cache (MIT)
- ipfs/go-log (MIT)
